<title>ITALY: Minimum rate 8.04 pct at Italy BOT buyback.</title>
<headline>Minimum rate 8.04 pct at Italy BOT buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The minimum rate at today's 2.5 trillion lire buyback of short term Treasury bills (BOTs) by the Bank of Italy was 8.04 percent compared with 8.40 percent previously, the Bank said.</p>
<p>The average rate was 8.10 percent against 8.50 percent at the previous operation for 750 billion lire on August 13.</p>
<p>The Bank said it received 17 bids of which 11 were met in full and one in part.</p>
